OL,3,ANvidia-backed AI data centre firm
OL,4,Ascraps landmark listing over market
OL,5,Afears
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirmus had initially announced plans
OL,8,Ffor a stock market debut that valued
OL,9,Fthe company at more than $30bn
OL,10,F(#22.65bn).
OL,12,FOne investment firm told the BBC that
OL,13,Fit had decided not take part in the
OL,14,Finitial public offering (IPO) over
OL,15,Fconcerns about its valuation.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
