OL,3,AWhy are more roofs not made of solar
OL,4,Atiles?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis is especially important for
OL,7,Fhistoric buildings, where heritage
OL,8,Frules limit changes to their
OL,9,Fappearance.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
