OL,4,ACelebrity Traitors banish two players
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis questionable strategy of revealing
OL,7,Fhe was a traitor to the other
OL,8,Fcelebrities in the bar led to the first
OL,9,Ftime in the UK version of the show that
OL,10,Fa traitor has been identified at the
OL,11,Fopening round table.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
